{"id":"00374","root":"uni00374_1","name":{"ja":"星乃　深月","en":"Hoshino Mitsuki"},"title":{"ja":"【扇嵐バニー】","en":"【Senran Bunny】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【扇嵐バニー】 星乃　深月","en":"【Senran Bunny】 Hoshino Mitsuki"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-08-31","limited":false,"characterId":166,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園を卒業し、対魔忍として活躍している。生真面目な性格で、実直に任務をこなしている。学園時代にはクラス委員としてクラスメイトから信頼されていた。高い戦闘能力と分析能力を有し、風遁使いとして、大きな扇を得物に相手を吹き飛ばし、切り刻む。学生時代の教官たちからはツメが甘いと怒られていたが、現在はその教訓を生かしてあまたの実績を上げている。対魔忍たちには尊敬され、敵対する者たちにも『扇嵐の対魔忍』と呼ばれ畏れられている。趣味は紅茶を飲むこと、読書、日光浴。好きな食べ物は、すき焼きと納豆。今回は特殊任務について、リゾート島のカジノに潜入し騒ぎを起こさず敵の情報を入手せよとの命を受け数名の対魔忍とともに潜入する。","en":"Hoshino Mitsuki graduated from Gosha Academy and now serves as a Taimanin. She is earnest and carries out missions with straightforward diligence. During her academy days she was a class representative trusted by her classmates. Possessing high combat and analytical skills, she wields wind-style ninjutsu, using a large fan as a weapon to blow opponents away and slice them. Her instructors once scolded her for having a soft edge, but she has since turned that lesson into countless achievements. She is respected by fellow Taimanin and feared by enemies, who call her the \"Fan Storm Taimanin.\" Her hobbies include drinking tea, reading, and sunbathing. Her favorite foods are sukiyaki and natto. For this special mission, she has been ordered to infiltrate a resort island casino with several other Taimanin, gather enemy intelligence, and cause no disturbance."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00374_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[878,1756],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[121,242],"def":[81,162],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","740009"]},{"id":"uni00374_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1356,2712],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[192,384],"def":[112,224],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","740009","7400