,5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"星乃、深月……ですっ……ち、違うんです、これはっ！　その――任務で、どうしても必要だったもので……私の趣味ではありません、本当です！","en":"Mitsuki Hoshino… that's me… n-no, that's not it! It's… something I needed for the mission… it's not a hobby, I swear!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"は、恥ずかしくなんてありませんっ、任務のためですから！　こういった仕事もあるということは、重々承知しているわけですし……","en":"I'm not embarrassed at all, it's for the mission! I'm well aware that such jobs exist…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"えっ？　こんな格好の私を、あまり大勢には見られたくない――ですか？　ふふっ……そうですか♪　仕方ない人ですね、隊長殿は♪","en":"Huh? You don't want a lot of people to see me like this…? Hehe… is that so♪ You're a hopeless one, Captain♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"はぁ……任務は無事に終わったのに、またこんな服を着ることになるなんて……あなたがどうしてもと言うからですよ？　まったく……","en":"Sigh… the mission went fine, yet I have to wear this again… because you insisted, right? Seriously…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"……嫌です。任務のときは仕方ありませんでしたが、この格好で出かけるなんて普通に無理です。あなた以外に、見せるつもりはありません","en":"…I don't like it. It was unavoidable during the mission, but going out like this is just impossible. I have no intention of showing anyone else."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"よ、夜中なら見られないからって、わざわざこんな時間に出歩かなくてもっ……まるで私に、変な趣味があるみたいじゃないですかっ……","en":"Y-you say no one will see me at night, but you still make me walk around at this hour… as if I have some strange fetish…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"任務外で、こんな服を着るわけないでしょうっ……まったく、スケベ心もほどほどにしてください","en":"I'd never wear this outside of a mission… seriously, tone down your lewd thoughts."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"あの、いかがでしょうか……なっ！？　あなたが着て欲しいといったから、頑張ったんです！　すぐに脱がそうとしたら、許しませんからね","en":"Um, what do you think… huh!? You asked me to wear it, so I worked hard! If you try to strip me off right away, I won't allow it."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ああっ、また溢れ出たのが内腿を伝って……んんぅっ♪　は、恥ずかしいところ、もっと見てぇ……♪","en":"Ahh, it's spilling down my inner thigh again… nnh…! So embarrassing, I want to see more…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00374_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"はふぁ、んぅ、わ、私はウサギだから万年発情期なのぉ♪　いつでもどこでもパコパコ準備おっけ～☆　あふぁっ……♪","en":"Hafa, nnu, I'm a rabbit, so I'm always in heat… ready for… sex anytime, anywhere☆ Ahfa…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00374_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"あはぁっ、はふ、お股からエッチな液体あふれっぱなしぃ……♪　ねえ、早く補充し直してぇ……♪","en":"Ahah, haf, erotic fluid keeps spilling from my crotch…♪ Hey, refill it quickly…♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00374_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00374_1/uni00374_1_dmg_2.og